  "body": "## Release Notes\r\n\r\n### :rocket: New features\r\n\r\n- **(plotter)** Made plotter startup faster\r\n\r\n- **(detach)** Detach added\r\n\r\n- **(export)** Exported chart same as chosen chart\r\n\r\n- **(charts)** New chart types added\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### :bug: Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- **(detach)** Re-inject BLE Disconnected after nested shell\r\n\r\n- **(detach)** Recover USB by identity and keep BLE/serial resilient\r\n\r\n- **(detach)** Preserve BLE, hand off Ctrl+P, and reconnect after flash\r\n\r\n- **(detach)** Release transports and rediscover port on reattach\r\n\r\n- **(finite)** No finite points to export bug fixed\r\n\r\n- **(plotter)** Honor --chart type in SVG export\r\n\r\n- **(plotter)** Swap markers for line and scatter chart types\r\n\r\n\r\n![detach](https://vhs.charm.sh/vhs-7rwjKq2E3xA9vCD6eWxzUM.gif)\r\n\r\n![plot](https://vhs.charm.sh/vhs-2qBzoJDYN4P2rjrZPZFtfn.gif)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Download comchan 0.15.0\r\n\r\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\r\n|--------|----------|----------|\r\n| [comchan-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\r\n| [comchan-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\r\n| [comchan-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Vaishnav-Sabari-Girish/ComChan/releases/download/v0.15.0/comchan-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\r\n\r\n\r\n"
